---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import SegnapostoSchermata from '../../components/SegnapostoSchermata.astro';

// Le sezioni della scheda, nell'ordine in cui rispondono alle domande di chi
// legge: cosa capisce, come mette in ordine, cosa succede se manca la rete,
// che tono ha, e dove finiscono i dati.
//
// Due frasi qui dentro sono state corrette contro i documenti di Pronto e non
// vanno "migliorate" senza rileggerli: la lista corta in vista (la specifica
// vieta l'overwhelm visivo, ma nulla viene nascosto o perso) e la spinta, che
// e' un incoraggiamento breve e non un primo passo operativo inventato dall'AI.
const sezioni = [
  {
    titolo: 'It understands the job, not just the sentence.',
    testo:
      'Add a task, move it to Thursday, mark it as done, delete it, or ask what is due today. Pronto understands ordinary speech as an action on your list. If it is not sure which task you mean, it asks. Deleting always requires confirmation.',
  },
  {
    titolo: 'It decides what comes first.',
    testo:
      'Every task gets a weight, and dated tasks become more urgent as their deadline approaches. Pronto uses those signals to keep a short list in view while everything else remains safely stored. The order changes as the days pass, so you never have to sort the whole backlog yourself.',
  },
  {
    titolo: 'Nothing gets lost while the AI thinks.',
    testo:
      'Your words are saved on your iPhone before any AI processing begins, so capture still works offline. When a connection is available, Pronto catches up in the background and reads any dates or times you mentioned. If that processing fails, the task stays in your list and you can try again.',
  },
  {
    titolo: 'A nudge, not a plan.',
    testo:
      'Instead of inventing a first step for you, Pronto adds a short, relevant line of encouragement. It changes so it does not turn into wallpaper. The nudge is Pronto’s; the plan stays yours.',
  },
  {
    titolo: 'Less guilt. A better place to begin.',
    testo:
      'Pronto never counts how many times you postpone something, tells you off, or treats procrastination as a character flaw. Optional reminders bring back only the tasks you choose.',
  },
  {
    titolo: 'Your key, your list.',
    testo:
      'Pronto uses the AI provider you choose, with your own key kept in the iPhone’s keychain. Your list lives on your phone. There is no Pronto account, and none of your list is stored on a Pronto server.',
  },
];

const stato = 'In testing — not on the App Store yet.';
---

<Base
  titolo="Pronto — say it once, and the list sorts itself | TROVA.ME"
  descrizione="Pronto is a to-do list you talk to. Say what you have to do, and it captures the task immediately, understands it, and decides what comes first."
>
  <h1>Say it once. The list sorts itself.</h1>
  <p class="stato">{stato}</p>
  <p>
    Pronto is a to-do list for people who put things off. Say what you have to do the way
    you would say it to a friend: call the accountant before Friday, move the dentist to
    Thursday. Pronto saves your words immediately, then understands what you meant and
    turns them into an action on your list.
  </p>

  {sezioni.map((sezione) => (
    <section>
      <h2>{sezione.titolo}</h2>
      <p>{sezione.testo}</p>
    </section>
  ))}

  <p>
    You probably do not need another place to store what you should do. Pronto is for the
    smaller, harder moment: getting it out of your head and making the list feel possible.
  </p>

  <SegnapostoSchermata app="Pronto" />
</Base>

<style>
  .stato {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0.125rem 0.625rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: var(--sfondo-tenue);
    color: var(--testo-tenue);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
  }

  section p {
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
  }
</style>
